# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.


## [Released]

## [2.0.0] - 2026-11-19
- Added precompiled CUDA kernels (PTX), GPU needs no compiler anymore now.
- Added plotSphericalEnergyscape() function (Lambert and equirectangular), with help page and example.
- Added generateDirections() helper (2D, grid, equal-area, Fibonacci, hexagonal).
- Added plot3DEnergyscape() function (point cloud and isosurfaces), with help page and example.
- Added general 3D acoustic imaging example.
- Added calculatePassiveAcousticImage() for passive imaging: MVDR, robust Capon (RCB) and DAS on GPU, CPU and native, with help page and example.
- Added simulatePassiveMicrophoneData() helper for broadband sound sources.
- Improved DMAS speed in GPU, CPU MEX and native versions (up to 190x for CPU DMAS5).
- Fixed errors and broken links in documentation and examples.
- Fixed GPU kernel out-of-bounds reads/writes.

## [1.4.0] - 2026-01-28
- Added publication link.

## [1.3.0] - 2026-01-07
- Added helper functions from examples as part of toolbox/namespace.

## [1.2.2] - 2026-01-07
- Fixed File exchange releases.

## [1.2.1] - 2026-01-07
- Switched compatibility to all Matlab versions. 
- Added missing project files to git.

## [1.2.0] - 2026-01-06
- Added plotPolarEnergyscape() function.
- Documentation and example improvements.

## [1.1.0] - 2026-01-05
- First public release.  
- Refactored for Matlab 2025 new toolbox creation procedure. 
- Fixed DMAS order 2 implementation for Mex and GPU versions. 

## [1.0.1] - 2025-09-29
- General documentation fixes.

## [1.0.0] - 2025-09-29
- First release.
